cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "mrf-honest"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kelly-Reif"
    given-names: "Chelsea"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Local retrieval, bounded inspection, and contracted DuckDB/Parquet ingestion of
  CMS hospital price-transparency JSON v3 files, with source-cited findings and
  methodology-safe rate representations. One published cohort comparison exists,
  deriving a versioned per-file presentation grade from persisted assessments;
  payer adapters and any published rate comparison are planned, not implemented.
  Pre-release: version and date-released will be added with the first dated release.
